==Appearance==
Yinlin is a slim woman of average height with a pale skin tone. She has magenta eyes with white pupils and a long red hair tied in a ponytail alongside a high bun.

===Clothing===
Yinlin wears a black [[wikipedia:Cheongsam|qipao]] with yellow accents. Her dress has side slits and an opening in the center of her chest and abdomen, revealing black sleeveless bodysuit underneath that is tied with a navy blue ribbon. She complements her outfit with long black gloves with yellow details and red palms, and a singular black earring. As for footwear, she opts for black heels with a golden platform and red trim.

